    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so permanent. like no matter how much i try to \"fix\" it or what i do to feel something, the grayness is just always there in the background. i'm just so tired of waiting for a color that's never coming. i feel like i'm just taking up space, waiting for something to happen that never will.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
