      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are deeply weary of the constant effort required just to exist, and the thought of silence feels like a profound escape from the internal noise. When the weight of just \"being\" becomes too much, those thoughts of cessation can feel like the only genuine relief. Because you are expressing thoughts about wanting the noise to stop, it is very important that you connect with support immediately. Please reach out to a crisis line or emergency service right now.",
